# criterion-cycle-scoped: a criterion A->B->A cycle exercised through the multi-file (scoped) validator path; must report criterion-cycle attributed to this library/file.
library "Root".

concept "Age Qualifies":
- type is Observation.
- code is `age`.

criterion "A":
- when ( "B" and "Age Qualifies" ).

criterion "B":
- when ( "A" ).
